    "IR remains NOT_COMPUTED. No chemical THz peak assignment or historical classification accuracy is changed.",
    "All old negative and failed results remain historical evidence; new dense-grid observations do not relabel prior runs.",
    "PID absence/current boot is not used as completion proof; root separately validates persisted wait4/seals and remote return."
  ],
